# The downloaded spec snapshot in provider-dev/downloaded/ IS committed:
# PagerDuty publishes the REST spec in the PagerDuty/api-schema GitHub
# repository without a version tag, and committing the snapshot makes every
# refresh a reviewable diff against the hash pin in
# provider-dev/config/spec_pin.json.

# integration test registry copy (rebuilt every run)
tests/integration/.registry-tmp/
